# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — cmake_find_mode=none 依赖的消费方 CMake 目标名桥接 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-01
# Software: etcd-cpp-apiv3 0.15.4 (依赖 grpc/1.70.0, protobuf/33.6)
# Gate: G2/conan create (test_package configure+link)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-E322
severity: 2
category: build-system|conan
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: test_package
approach: test_package 的 conanfile 用 tc.variables 显式指路（gRPC_DIR/Protobuf_DIR/utf8_range_DIR/absl_DIR/OPENSSL_ROOT_DIR 指向制品仓包的 lib/cmake/<name>），CMakeLists 先 find 真实 config，再用 INTERFACE IMPORTED 桥接 CMakeDeps 期望的目标名，并预置 <dep>_FOUND=TRUE 跳过生成 config 里的 find_dependency

keywords: cmake_find_mode, find_dependency, gRPCConfig.cmake, grpc_DIR, target not found, INTERFACE IMPORTED, 大小写

error_signature: Could not find a package configuration file provided by "grpc"|Target.*links to.*grpc::grpc.*but the target was not found|find_dependency\(grpc\)
match_keywords: cmake_find_mode,find_dependency,grpc_dir,target not found,interface imported

root_cause: grpc/protobuf 配方设 cmake_find_mode=none，CMakeDeps 不为其生成 config；消费方包的
  CMakeDeps 生成物（-config.cmake/-Target-release.cmake）引用默认目标名 grpc::grpc /
  protobuf::protobuf，而注册表包自带 config 实际定义 gRPC::*（gRPCTargets.cmake）与
  protobuf::libprotobuf；且 find_dependency(grpc) 用小写名搜索 grpc_DIR/grpcConfig.cmake，
  实际文件是大写 gRPCConfig.cmake，OHOS 文件系统大小写敏感导致双重失配
affected_scope: 所有依赖 grpc/protobuf（cmake_find_mode=none 包）的消费方 test_package，
  尤其是静态链接需要完整传递依赖闭包的场景

rec_priority: 1
